From 69ccd2ad1ab79d9056bb156db6bf67b13080c142 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ayiejosh <132535860+ayiejosh@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 03:08:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/43] pvr: report real storage-image limit (4 -> 32), probed
 not assumed

maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages was 4 - exactly the Vulkan minimum and with no backing
constant anywhere in the driver - and maxDescriptorSetStorageImages was derived as 3*4. An
application needing more than 4 storage images in a stage refuses to run.

Probed with bench/pvr-vulkan/storageimages: the shader stores index i into storage image i,
then reads each image back into an SSBO, so a single buffer readback proves both that image i
is addressable and that it holds the value written to image i (aliasing or a short array would
show wrong values, not zeros):

  NIMG=4   4 correct, 0 wrong
  NIMG=8   8 correct, 0 wrong
  NIMG=16 16 correct, 0 wrong
  NIMG=32 32 correct, 0 wrong

Set to 32 per stage and 3*32 per set, matching the sampler fix.

No regressions: bda, vk13, pctest, vk16, wgsize, samplers all PASS; glmark2 --validate still
0 failures / 27 pass.
---
 src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
index ca92d6c..57c2fd8 100644
--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
@@ -760,7 +760,10 @@ static bool pvr_physical_device_get_properties(
       .maxPerStageDescriptorUniformBuffers = 13,
       .maxPerStageDescriptorStorageBuffers = 16,
       .maxPerStageDescriptorSampledImages = 32,
-      .maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages = 4,
+      /* Probed (bench/pvr-vulkan/storageimages): 32 storage images in one stage all store
+       * and read back their own correct value, while this was reported as 4 - the Vulkan
+       * minimum - which makes applications needing more refuse to run. */
+      .maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages = 32,
       .maxPerStageDescriptorInputAttachments = 4,
       .maxPerStageResources = 57,
       .maxDescriptorSetSamplers = 3U * 32U,
@@ -769,7 +772,7 @@ static bool pvr_physical_device_get_properties(
       .maxDescriptorSetStorageBuffers = 3U * 4U,
       .maxDescriptorSetStorageBuffersDynamic = 4U,
       .maxDescriptorSetSampledImages = 3U * 32U,
-      .maxDescriptorSetStorageImages = 3U * 4U,
+      .maxDescriptorSetStorageImages = 3U * 32U,
       .maxDescriptorSetInputAttachments = 4U,
 
       /* Vertex Shader Limits */
